---
import AdminLayout from '../../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
const stages=['triage','investigating','waiting_user','fix_pending','release_pending','verify_pending','resolved'];
---
<AdminLayout title="反馈处理">
  <section data-operations="feedback">
    <form id="ops-filter"><label>用户 ID<input name="userId" /></label><label>内部阶段<select name="stage"><option value="">全部</option>{stages.map(s=><option>{s}</option>)}</select></label><label>优先级<select name="priority"><option value="">全部</option>{['urgent','high','normal','low'].map(s=><option>{s}</option>)}</select></label><label>开始时间<input type="datetime-local" name="from" /></label><label>结束时间<input type="datetime-local" name="to" /></label><button>查询</button></form>
    <p>默认未完成优先，再按更新时间排列。优先级仅供分诊。</p><p id="ops-status" role="status"></p><div id="ops-items"></div><button id="ops-next" hidden>下一页</button>
  </section>
</AdminLayout>
<script>import '../../../lib/admin-operations-client';</script>
